Show the details and captured output of a task run

Usage:
  cron-person task log <run-id> [flags]

Arguments:
  <run-id>            Run ID shown by task history

Flags:
  -f, --follow     Keep printing output as it is captured until the run finishes
  -h, --help       help for log
      --tail int   Show only the last N output lines (0 shows all)

Global Flags:
      --config string   Path to custom configuration file (default:
                        $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
      --store string    Path to custom authorization state file (default:
                        $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
